      "writtenOn": "2022-12-14T01:05:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I don\u0027t think there\u0027s any reason to treat linkerconfig specially given that with aosp/2347947 it\u0027s now a simple executable which happens to be in the runtime apex. I\u0027m preparing a further cleanup to remove hard-coded \"linkerconfig\" in build/soong.\n\nIf any new changes miss linkerconfig by accident, it would be caught immediately because linkerconfig is so essential.",
